### 1. Add Employee 1
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@gmail.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "salary": 55000.0
}

###

### 2. Add Employee 2
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@gmail.com",
  "department": "HR",
  "salary": 60000.0
}

###

### 3. Get All Employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

###

### 4. Get Employee By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/1

###

### 5. Update Employee Details
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Johnathan Doe",
  "email": "johnathan.doe@gmail.com",
  "department": "IT Support",
  "salary": 58000.0
}

###

### 6. Apply Leave Request for Employee 1
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveType": "CASUAL",
  "startDate": "2026-09-20",
  "endDate": "2026-09-22",
  "reason": "Personal work",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "employee": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

###

### 7. Apply Second Leave Request for Employee 1
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveType": "SICK",
  "startDate": "2026-10-05",
  "endDate": "2026-10-06",
  "reason": "Fever",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "employee": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

###

### 8. Get All Leave Requests
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves

###

### 9. Get Leave Request By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/1

###

### 10. Get All Leaves of a Specific Employee (Medium-Level Requirement)
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/1/leaves

###

### 11. Update Leave Status (Approve Leave)
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

###

### 12. Delete Leave Request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/leaves/2

###

### 13. Delete Employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/employees/2